touch",{"id":221,"data":223,"filePath":115},{"year":39,"venue":224,"title":226,"authors":228,"self":108,"links":231,"award":61},{"short":225,"type":166},"iScience",{"en":227},"Passive human touch cannot recognize the shape of a pattern imprinted on the fingertip",[229,108,110,230],"S. Kuroki","S. Nishida",{"doi":232},"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2025.112331","robomech2023-tgi-arrangement2",{"id":233,"data":235,"filePath":115},{"year":119,"venue":236,"title":239,"authors":242,"self":243,"links":247,"award":61},{"short":237,"type":238},"ROBOMECH","domestic",{"en":240,"ja":241},"Examination of Stimulus Arrangement in the Chemical Thermal Grill Illusion (Second Report)","化学物質を用いたサーマルグリル錯覚における刺激配置の検討 第二報",[243,244,245,246],"浜崎 拓海","金田 実久","金子 征太郎","梶本 裕之",{},"si2023-alcohol",{"id":248,"data":250,"filePath":115},{"year":119,"venue":251,"title":253,"authors":256,"self":243,"links":260,"award":262},{"short":252,"type":238},"SICE SI",{"en":254,"ja":255},"Ubiquitous Cold Sensation Presentation Using Alcohol Evaporation","アルコールの揮発を利用したユビキタスな冷感提示",[243,257,258,259,246],"高見 太基","牛山 奎悟","溝口 泉",{"pdf":261},"https://kaji-lab.jp/ja/index.php?plugin=attach&pcmd=open&file=hamazaki_si23.pdf&refer=hamazaki",{"en":263,"ja":264},"Best Presentation Award","優秀講演賞","si2023-baghaptic",{"id":265,"data":267,"filePath":115},{"year":119,"venue":268,"title":269,"authors":271,"self":243,"links":272,"award":273},{"short":252,"type":238},{"en":270},"Development of Bag-installed Haptic Device to Deliver Vibration and Pressure Feedback in Everyday Life",[258,243,246],{},{"en":263,"ja":264},"siggraphasia2025-enchantedtouch",{"id":274,"data":276,"filePath":115},{"year":39,"venue":277,"title":279,"authors":281,"self":108,"links":283,"award":285},{"short":278,"type":99},"SIGGRAPH Asia E-Tech",{"en":280},"Enchanted Touch: Delivering Vibrotactile and Thermal Feedback Without Fingerpad Contact",[108,282,170,171,173],"T. Maeda",{"doi":284},"https://doi.org/10.1145/3757373.3763767",{"en":286},"Emerging Technologies Honorable Mention Award","vrsj2021-tgi",{"id":287,"data":289,"filePath":115},{"year":290,"venue":291,"title":293,"authors":296,"self":243,"links":298,"award":61},2021,{"short":292,"type":238},"VRSJ Annual",{"en":294,"ja":295},"Thermal Grill Illusion Using Chemical Substances","化学物質を用いたサーマルグリル錯覚",[243,244,297,245,246],"張 建堯",{"pdf":299},"https://kaji-lab.jp/ja/index.php?plugin=attach&pcmd=open&file=vrsj2021_hamazaki.pdf&refer=hamazaki","vrsj2022-popping",{"id":300,"data":302,"filePath":115},{"year":96,"venue":303,"title":304,"authors":307,"self":243,"links":309,"award":61},{"short":292,"type":238},{"en":305,"ja":306},"Comparison of Popping Sensation Presentation Using a Mixture of Glue Spray and Cold Spray","のりスプレーとコールドスプレーの混合物を用いた破裂感提示の比較",[243,308,245,246],"宮上 昌大",{"pdf":310},"https://kaji-lab.jp/ja/index.php?plugin=attach&pcmd=open&file=3B2-1.pdf&refer=hamazaki","vrsj2022-tgi-arrangement",{"id":311,"data":313,"filePath":115},{"year":96,"venue":314,"title":315,"authors":318,"self":243,"links":319,"award":321},{"short":292,"type":238},{"en":316,"ja":317},"Examination of Stimulus Arrangement in the Chemical Thermal Grill Illusion","化学物質を用いたサーマルグリル錯覚における刺激配置の検討",[243,244,245,246],{"pdf":320},"https://kaji-lab.jp/ja/index.php?plugin=attach&pcmd=open&file=2B2-3.pdf&refer=hamazaki",{"en":322,"ja":323},"Encouragement Award","学術奨励賞","themes",["Map",326,327,339,340,351,352],"chemical-haptics",{"id":326,"data":328,"filePath":338},{"title":329,"description":332,"stats":335},{"en":330,"ja":331},"Chemical Haptics","ケミカルハプティクス",{"en":333,"ja":334},"Using chemical substances to evoke thermal and tactile sensations. I induce the thermal grill illusion — a burning sensation from interleaved warm and cold — chemically rather than with thermal devices, and present popping sensations from sprays, linking stimulus design to perception through psychophysics.","化学物質を用いて温度感覚や触感を生み出す研究。温冷交互刺激による灼熱感（サーマルグリル錯覚）を、熱デバイスではなく化学的に誘発する研究や、スプレーによる破裂感提示など。刺激設計と知覚を心理物理実験で結びつける。",{"en":336,"ja":337},"6 papers","論文6","src/data/themes.json","electrical-stimulation",{"id":339,"data":341,"filePath":338},{"title":342,"description":345,"stats":348},{"en":343,"ja":344},"Electrical Stimulation","電気刺激触覚",{"en":346,"ja":347},"Making electro-tactile displays comfortable and expressive. By applying anesthetic cream I suppress the itch and pain of electrical stimulation and widen its usable dynamic range, enabling stronger and clearer pressure and vibration cues.","電気触覚ディスプレイを快適かつ表現力豊かにする研究。麻酔クリームの併用で電気刺激に伴う痒みや痛みを抑え、利用可能なダイナミックレンジを拡張して、より強く明瞭な圧覚・振動提示を可能にする。",{"en":349,"ja":350},"2 papers","論文2","thermal-cooling-feedback",{"id":351,"data":353,"filePath":338},{"title":354,"description":357,"stats":360},{"en":355,"ja":356},"Thermal & Cooling Feedback","温冷フィードバック",{"en":358,"ja":359},"Wearable devices that deliver warmth and cold in everyday settings. ALCool harnesses alcohol's evaporative cooling for ubiquitous cold feedback, and Enchanted Touch layers thermal and vibrotactile cues onto real objects without covering the fingerpad.","日常環境で温かさ・冷たさを提示するウェアラブルデバイス。ALCool はアルコールの気化熱を利用したユビキタスな冷感提示、Enchanted Touch は指腹を覆わずに実物体へ温冷・振動を重ねて提示する。",{"en":349,"ja":350}]